      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"source-doc\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #c9c3bb;border-radius:7px;padding:16px 19px;line-height:1.64;color:#242424;overflow-wrap:anywhere\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #aaa5a0;padding:13px 15px;margin:12px 0 15px;background:#fff\"><div style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:800;font-size:1.08em;margin:0 0 12px\">Kramer’s Emporium</div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:12px\">2323 Raleigh Street • Houston, TX 77021</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">After 25 years in business, our store is closing. Everything must go!</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">From refrigerators to washing machines, we have hundreds of brand-new appliances for your home or office. Most items have been marked down by 30 percent. Delivery is available within 60 miles of our store for a flat fee of $50.00. We are open daily from 9:00 A.M. to 7:00 P.M.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\"><strong>Don’t wait! Merchandise is selling fast!</strong></p></div></div>",
